  SuitSprite: {fileID: 0}
  CardStory: "Spades2 takes a look at himself in the cheap mirror. His uniform is
    within regulations. Black hair, black eyes with dark bags under them, the consequence
    of one too many late nights on the training courts. \r\n\r\nMost of all, he feels
    the weight of the spikes that adorn his shoulders, marking his division and rank.
    Adorn\u2026 Is not the right word. These will soon be part of him, and will feed
    on his marrow in exchange for power. Making him more.\r\n\r\nAnd he will need
    to be more, if he is to keep up with the rest. For now, though, his bones and
    humanity are intact.  \r\n\r\nSpades2 moves his hand up to adjust his lapel and
    his reflection follows, after which he passes a thin comb through messy locks
    and tames the worst of his bed hair.\r\n\r\nServiceable, for a first day. He
    hopes it will be enough."
